Build against modern libxml2 (2.13+). Three API drifts since 2012:
1. <libxml/SAX.h> is a deprecated stub that no longer transitively includes
   the parser headers, so xmlParserCtxtPtr is undeclared in
   rsvg-private.h/rsvg-mask.h/rsvg-styles.h — include <libxml/parser.h>.
2. xmlStructuredErrorFunc's error parameter became const xmlError*
   (libxml2 2.12) — rsvg_xml_noerror's signature must match or the
   handler.serror assignment is an incompatible-function-pointer error.
3. xmlCtxtGetLastError returns const xmlError* (2.13) — rsvg_set_error's
   local must be const.
The same class of fixes distros carry for old librsvg on new libxml2.

--- a/rsvg-private.h
+++ b/rsvg-private.h
@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@
 
 #include "rsvg.h"
 
-#include <libxml/SAX.h>
+#include <libxml/parser.h> /* modern libxml2: SAX.h is a deprecated stub that no longer pulls in the parser types (xmlParserCtxtPtr) */
 #include <libxml/xmlmemory.h>
 #include <pango/pango.h>
 #include <glib.h>
